{"id":"n82570-1-9","stage":4,"title":"탈의실 · 更衣室","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82570-1-9-1","ko":"어, 내 모자가 어디 갔지?","zh":"哎，我的帽子去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모자가","meaning":"帽子","explanation":"모자：帽子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"모자","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69297","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔지?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4bf2a75000314226","term":"모자","zh":"帽子","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3","entryId":"69297","definition":"戴在头上以表示礼貌或阻挡严寒暑热等的东西。","pronunciation":["모자"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/14c4d8278cb26cdc5a6e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82570-1-9-2","ko":"옷 갈아입으면서 탈의실에 두고 온 거 아냐?","zh":"是不是换衣服的时候忘在更衣室里了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"옷","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈아입으면서","meaning":"换，换穿","explanation":"갈아입다：换，换穿；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"갈아입다","audio":"/audio/83e13541ecbec8ff35d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53830","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈아입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탈의실에","meaning":"更衣室","explanation":"탈의실：更衣室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"탈의실","audio":"/audio/b54290e702d3be2a7eba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82570","senseId":"1","lemma":"탈의실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두고","meaning":"撇下，丢下，落","explanation":"두다：撇下，丢下，落；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"3","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"온","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"以为","explanation":"알다：以为；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"12","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"83e13541ecbec8ff","term":"갈아입다","zh":"换，换穿","audio":"/audio/83e13541ecbec8ff35d7.mp3","entryId":"53830","definition":"把身上的衣服脱掉，改穿别的衣服。","pronunciation":["가라입따"]},{"id":"b54290e702d3be2a","term":"탈의실","zh":"更衣室","audio":"/audio/b54290e702d3be2a7eba.mp3","entryId":"82570","definition":"专供脱衣或更换衣服的房间。","pronunciation":["타릐실","타리실"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"撇下，丢下，落","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"不带走，遗留或丢弃。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"以为","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实，认为或觉得如此。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/00682e0538a9b3091dd5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.637,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82570","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":131,"sequenceScore":2.4637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是不是换衣服的时候忘在更衣室里了？","哎，我的帽子去哪儿了？","太冷了，手好像都冻僵了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哎，我的帽子去哪儿了？","太冷了，手好像都冻僵了。","是不是换衣服的时候忘在更衣室里了？"],"answer":2}]}
